==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|persona||person}} + {{m|la|non||not}} + {{m|la|grata}} (from {{m|la|gratus||acceptable}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/pə(ɹ)ˈsəʊnə nɒn ˈɡɹɑːtə/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|personae non gratae}}

# A person who is not [[welcome]], especially a [[diplomat]] in a [[foreign]] [[country]].

====Usage notes====
Sometimes incorrectly pluralized as [[personas non grata]].

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|persona grata}}

